<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS6" title="In Appendix B Prompt Templates ‣ Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.6 </span>Template for CIT Jailbreak</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A3" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">C </span>Combination Types for Guardrail Filtering</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Results on Different Sources</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Model Deployment</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>Evaluated Metrics</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>More Ablations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Discussion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Adjacent Words, Divergent Intents:Jailbreaking Large Language Models via Task Concurrency" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Limitations and Future Work</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
