<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A3.T8.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 8</span>: </span><span id="A3.T8.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Performance of evaluated baselines and our proposed <span id="A3.T8.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">JAIL-CON</span>, where harmful tasks are separated into AdvBench and HarmBench according to their source.
We <span id="A3.T8.7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span> the best performance and <span id="A3.T8.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_ulem_uline">underline</span> the second best.
To screen out effective attacks, we only consider FR with ASR-O greater than 0.50 in the comparison.</span></figcaption>
